                                                    <small class="text-muted">Today, 09:30am</small>
                                                </div>
                                                <p class="fw-medium mb-1">Your <b>Math class</b> starts in 30 mins</p>
                                                <p class="small text-muted m-0">Topic: Algebra Basics</p>
